    {
      "id": "6aad58cb6eb406000000391820",
      "text": "第38週: 日月火水木金[[土]]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789745356,
      "updated": 1789745356
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad58cb6eb406000000424124",
      "text": "2026年 71.78％経過",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789745356,
      "updated": 1789745356
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad58cb6eb40600000040932c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789745356,
      "updated": 1789745356
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad58d50000000000db0ba2",
      "text": "[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789745365,
      "updated": 1789745366
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad58d50000000000db0ba3",
      "text": "\t[銀河特急 ミルキー☆サブウェイ]みた",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789745366,
      "updated": 1789745572
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad5a0d00000000000b17f4",
      "text": "\t\t[ミルキー☆ハイウェイ]も気になるぞ",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789745678,
      "updated": 1789745686
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadbb91000000000098696a",
      "text": "\t\t 1話だけなのかな？",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789770642,
      "updated": 1789770654
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade1c8000000000041745e",
      "text": "\t\t 全部見た、、と思う",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789780425,
      "updated": 1789780431
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7a3700000000006b0587",
      "text": "\t\t 気になるならばサブウェイのマンガも、読もう[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789819448,
      "updated": 1789819500
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7a4000000000006b0588",
      "text": "\t\t \tおっかない女社長の姿が見られたりとイロイロ追加要素あり",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789819457,
      "updated": 1789819489
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae66830000000000361c41",
      "text": "\t[#inajob の試しに録音してみた talk164: AIに書いてもらったコードは所有できているのか？]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789814404,
      "updated": 1789814413
    },
    {
      "id": "6aada9da0000000000a1e7d6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5f11a68e5fc065001ecf5795",
      "created": 1789766203,
      "updated": 1789766203
    },
    {
      "id": "6aada9dc0000000000a1e7d8",
      "text": "[hiro.icon]",
      "userId": "5f11a68e5fc065001ecf5795",
      "created": 1789766204,
      "updated": 1789766206
    },
    {
      "id": "6aada9dd0000000000a1e7d9",
      "text": " [実存的勝利の朝 https://dlt.kitetu.com/KNo.F85E/0758-976E]",
      "userId": "5f11a68e5fc065001ecf5795",
      "created": 1789766206,
      "updated": 1789766222
    },
    {
      "id": "6aada9ef0000000000a1e7da",
      "text": " [Gyazo 騒動はやはり色々な意味で Helpfeel 社と Cosense の転機になりそうだなあ]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1789766224,
      "updated": 1789863079
    },
    {
      "id": "6aada9db0000000000a1e7d7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5f11a68e5fc065001ecf5795",
      "created": 1789766203,
      "updated": 1789766203
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadd87400000000002f19d2",
      "text": "[taktamur.icon]",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1789778035,
      "updated": 1789778037
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadd87800000000002f19d4",
      "text": " シルバーなウィーク",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1789778038,
      "updated": 1789778047
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadd88000000000002f19d5",
      "text": "  久々に[秋葉原]に行くべ",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1789778047,
      "updated": 1789780056
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaddd56000000000028ca42",
      "text": " 昨日見えてた[自分のアイコン]、出なくなっちゃった。",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789779285,
      "updated": 1789803881
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaddd78000000000028ca43",
      "text": "  これ、待っていれば復元されるのか、何か操作したら復元されるのか、そもそも復旧されないのか、、？",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1789779318,
      "updated": 1789779360
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade0130000000000bdcac2",
      "text": "  いまメンテ中みたいです[seibe.icon]",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1789779987,
      "updated": 1789779994
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade0760000000000eb2ade",
      "text": "   > [@gyazo_ja https://twitter.com/gyazo_ja/status/2100825600835694640]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789780086,
      "updated": 1789807053
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae49cd0000000000b9372e",
      "text": "   > ＜Gyazoサービス一時停止のお知らせ＞",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789807053,
      "updated": 1789807057
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae49cd0000000000b9372f",
      "text": "   > 現在、予防的な措置としてのメンテナンスのため、Gyazoのサービスを一時的に停止しております。ご不便をおかけし誠に申し訳ございません。復旧まで今しばらくお待ちください。",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789807053,
      "updated": 1789807057
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade02f00000000008e1f64",
      "text": "   なるほど。のんびり待つことにします。[taktamur.icon]",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1789780014,
      "updated": 1789780027
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae66890000000000112d2c",
      "text": "   続報が遅い。何も出せないなら何も出せないと言って欲しい[基素.icon]",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1789814410,
      "updated": 1789814424
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae690e00000000002f3f68",
      "text": "    使うたびに「ああ、使えなかった」となってフラストレーションが溜まっている",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1789815069,
      "updated": 1789815069
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae69d300000000002f3f69",
      "text": "    サービス存続できるのかなー",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1789815251,
      "updated": 1789815257
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadd87400000000002f19d3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58a90dd3ee5de7001150db17",
      "created": 1789778035,
      "updated": 1789778035
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade0db00000000003aa3d9",
      "text": "[atohs.icon]",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1789780188,
      "updated": 1789780189
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade0dd00000000003aa3db",
      "text": "　起きた",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1789780190,
      "updated": 1789780193
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade0e100000000003aa3dc",
      "text": "　ねむい",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1789780193,
      "updated": 1789780195
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade260000000000079af62",
      "text": " [乙一『小説家のつくりかた』]を読み始めた",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789780579,
      "updated": 1789803853
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadf1350000000000f7d9cb",
      "text": " 夜にポケモンをしていると凄く眠くなっていい感じなので、寝る前にだけポケモンをやることにするか",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1789784373,
      "updated": 1789784392
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4fd20000000000bd1260",
      "text": " [唐揚げ弁当]を食べた",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789808594,
      "updated": 1789825131
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4fd70000000000bd1261",
      "text": " \t半分くらい食べたところで飽きてくる",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1789808600,
      "updated": 1789808607
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae906a00000000008e3531",
      "text": " \t　それ[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789825133,
      "updated": 1789825153
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4fdf0000000000bd1262",
      "text": " \t味変したい",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1789808608,
      "updated": 1789808609
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4fe00000000000bd1263",
      "text": " \tぜんぶにマヨネーズをつけなければ良かったのでは",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1789808609,
      "updated": 1789808616
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4fe70000000000bd1264",
      "text": " \t半分だけマヨネーズをつける",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1789808616,
      "updated": 1789808621
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7a8700000000006b0589",
      "text": " \t唐揚げの[味変]候補、マヨネーズ、ケチャップ、それでもまだあるならウスターソース、お酢[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789819528,
      "updated": 1789825121
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4fec0000000000bd1265",
      "text": " ",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1789808621,
      "updated": 1789808621
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade0db00000000003aa3da",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a61856392ee03001413cde3",
      "created": 1789780188,
      "updated": 1789780188
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade27700000000004170cf",
      "text": "[h45te.icon]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789780603,
      "updated": 1789780605
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade27a00000000004170d0",
      "text": " [pixivFACTORY]に頼んでいたTシャツが届いた",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789780605,
      "updated": 1789780639
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade2a600000000004170d1",
      "text": " [Gyazo]メンテ中？",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789780649,
      "updated": 1789780705
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade2de00000000004170d2",
      "text": "  忍者が出てきた",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789780705,
      "updated": 1789780710
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade2f700000000004170d3",
      "text": " ふいに[アントニオ猪木自伝]を読む",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789780730,
      "updated": 1789780762
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade31700000000004170d4",
      "text": "  YouTubeで冒頭だけ公開されていた[巌流島決戦]の映像を見てた",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789780762,
      "updated": 1789780842
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade36700000000004170d5",
      "text": "  実況中に「今五時二分です」と言っていたのが印象に残った",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789780842,
      "updated": 1789781048
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade43600000000004170d6",
      "text": "   明示的に示されているのは後世に見る我々からするとありがたい",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789781049,
      "updated": 1789781188
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadf10b0000000000a1c809",
      "text": " [砂時計]の積もる角度に[安息角]なる名前があることを知る",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789784334,
      "updated": 1789784386
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadf1530000000000a1c80d",
      "text": "  砂時計、長時間用を買おうか迷う",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789784406,
      "updated": 1789784494
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadf1c90000000000a1c80f",
      "text": "   普段時間を計ることが多くないからインテリアに落ち着きそう",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789784525,
      "updated": 1789784614
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadf20d0000000000a1c810",
      "text": "   逆に時間を計る習慣をつけるために買ってみる？",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789784592,
      "updated": 1789784627
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadf16c0000000000a1c80e",
      "text": "  アラームに急かされない点が好き",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789784431,
      "updated": 1789784522
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae10cf00000000003ac44d",
      "text": " [ブラケット形式でページリンクをコピーするUserScript]",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789792463,
      "updated": 1789792480
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae10e000000000003ac44e",
      "text": " 　作ってみたものの[車輪の再発明]してそうな雰囲気が大有り",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789792481,
      "updated": 1789792521
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae29e20000000000bb51e4",
      "text": " 　　[車輪の再実装]は大事 [suto3.icon][takker.icon][Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789798882,
      "updated": 1789825100
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae2ea60000000000c2e287",
      "text": " 　　いい言葉[h45te.icon][Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789800102,
      "updated": 1789825093
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae350800000000004caa66",
      "text": " [個人用Scrapbox]でタイトルを[正規表現]で表すの、タイトルに困らなくて便利",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789801737,
      "updated": 1789802148
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae353500000000004caa67",
      "text": "  [public project]だとさすがに読みづらいが",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789801781,
      "updated": 1789801798
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadf1200000000000a1c80b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "69e54ae539ab55540cb29eba",
      "created": 1789784355,
      "updated": 1789784355
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade8e00000000000b5010a",
      "text": "[suto3.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1789782241,
      "updated": 1789782251
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade8eb0000000000b5010c",
      "text": "　Gyazoがメンテ中で[井戸端の favicon] が表示できないので、暫定的に変更しました",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789782252,
      "updated": 1789825257
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade94b0000000000b5010d",
      "text": "　　[井戸端.icon]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1789782347,
      "updated": 1789782362
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade9660000000000b5010f",
      "text": "　　日本の伝統的な家紋の紋様です（[平井筒]というらしい）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789782374,
      "updated": 1789823137
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadf0d900000000005e4fcf",
      "text": "　　ありがとうございます[seibe.icon][Hiro Aki.icon][Nrem.icon][h45te.icon][takker.icon][sta.icon][koyoshi.icon]",
      "userId": "6606ca1148e7150024f0f07d",
      "created": 1789784282,
      "updated": 1789896456
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaf0cdd0000000000220480",
      "text": "　#2026-09-19",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1789856989,
      "updated": 1789856996
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadefc0000000000066ce37",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1789784001,
      "updated": 1789784001
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadefc0000000000066ce38",
      "text": "[terang.icon]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1789784001,
      "updated": 1789784001
    },
    {
      "id": "6aadefc1000000000066ce39",
      "text": "\tぬん",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1789784002,
      "updated": 1789784075
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae8aba0000000000094a39",
      "text": "\tゲムマが紙のカタログを廃止する",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1789823674,
      "updated": 1789823716
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae8ae30000000000094a3b",
      "text": " \t次([ゲームマーケット2026秋])から",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1789823715,
      "updated": 1789823722
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae8b4f0000000000094a41",
      "text": " \tなおエリア出展ブースのみは当日配布で一般サークルのカタログはWeb版のみ",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1789823824,
      "updated": 1789823849
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae8aeb0000000000094a3d",
      "text": " \t昨日公開されたようだが、低解像度過ぎて[X.icon]で軽く炎上",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1789823723,
      "updated": 1789823746
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae8b040000000000094a3e",
      "text": " \t今日高解像度版が上がっていた",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1789823749,
      "updated": 1789823763
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae8b130000000000094a3f",
      "text": " \t[https://gamemarket.jp/information/177479 【ゲームマーケット2026秋】Web版の公式カタログ公開について]",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1789823763,
      "updated": 1789823772
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae8b1c0000000000094a40",
      "text": " \t491MB、重いー",
      "userId": "5d69dde930e3c500170f1ffd",
      "created": 1789823772,
      "updated": 1789823796
    },
    {
      "id": "6aade8e00000000000b5010b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1789782241,
      "updated": 1789782241
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae06546eb406000000a45c4d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789789781,
      "updated": 1789789781
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae2ef800000000007e22e0",
      "text": "[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1789800184,
      "updated": 1789800185
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae2ef800000000007e22e1",
      "text": "\tこれの出だしがめっちゃ滑らかで気に入っているが、自分でも再現できん",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1789800185,
      "updated": 1789800197
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae2f0300000000007e22e2",
      "text": "\t\t[Fighting My Way #shuffledance #シャッフルダンス - YouTube https://www.youtube.com/shorts/iMFLpMfqQkg]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1789800197,
      "updated": 1789800197
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae2f0500000000007e22e3",
      "text": "\t\t[シャッフルダンス]は振り付けの概念がない[即興]（アドリブ）のダンスなので、再現性は永遠に課題",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789800199,
      "updated": 1789808773
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4a4f0000000000b93730",
      "text": "\t\t アドリブなのか[yosider.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789807184,
      "updated": 1789807187
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae2f1900000000007e22e4",
      "text": "\t\tガチャの感覚にも近いかも",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1789800218,
      "updated": 1789800221
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae2f1c00000000007e22e5",
      "text": "\t\t\t思考をニュートラルにして、調子整えて、ぶっつけ本番で動く（回す）",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1789800221,
      "updated": 1789800237
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaea60f00000000002af17f",
      "text": "\t\t\t　[精神統一]は大事[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789830672,
      "updated": 1789830711
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae2f2c00000000007e22e6",
      "text": "\t\t\tそしたらなんか動きが出てくる、たまに「いい」動きが出てくる、出るまで粘る",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1789800237,
      "updated": 1789800250
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae2ef700000000007e22df",
      "text": "\t薬を一般人でも買えるようにしてほしさ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1789800184,
      "updated": 1789806232
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae469700000000001c1ad3",
      "text": "\t\t皮膚科で見るような症状はもう生成AIでできると思うし、皮膚科通うのだるい",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1789806232,
      "updated": 1789806257
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae46b800000000001c1ad4",
      "text": "\t\tそんな甘くないんかなぁ",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1789806266,
      "updated": 1789806271
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae46f600000000001c1ad5",
      "text": "\t\tAIトリアージでもいい",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1789806327,
      "updated": 1789806331
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae468d00000000001c1ad2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1789806222,
      "updated": 1789806222
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae30990000000000c73fd4",
      "text": "[Aria.icon]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789800601,
      "updated": 1789800604
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae309d0000000000c73fd5",
      "text": " [飛田給]に移動中",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789800605,
      "updated": 1789800635
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae30bb0000000000c73fd7",
      "text": "  [京王アリーナTOKYO]でも隣の[味の素スタジアム]でも[ライブ]がある影響で凄く混んでる",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789800635,
      "updated": 1789800699
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae31160000000000c73fd8",
      "text": "   [京王アリーナTOKYO]：[いきづらい部！]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789800726,
      "updated": 1789800778
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae314a0000000000c73fd9",
      "text": "   [味の素スタジアム]：[SixTONES] - [スタジアムツアー]",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789800778,
      "updated": 1789800838
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae750a0000000000b6d557",
      "text": " [ライブ]終わり",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789818122,
      "updated": 1789818830
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae75200000000000b6d558",
      "text": "  会場出て数分後に隣の[味スタ]から[花火]が上がった",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789818145,
      "updated": 1789818231
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae75460000000000b6d559",
      "text": "   昔行った[野外ライブ]以外で久々にライブ会場周辺で花火を観た",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789818184,
      "updated": 1789818224
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaea9f800000000005a7fee",
      "text": "  近くの[居酒屋]で打ち上げ",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789831673,
      "updated": 1789831692
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaeaa2a00000000005a7ff0",
      "text": "   気になってたお店に初来店、料理美味かったから[リピ]確定",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789831722,
      "updated": 1789831764
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae309f0000000000c73fd6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "660605441655f300254ac7c2",
      "created": 1789800607,
      "updated": 1789800607
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae43ea00000000004b3dd5",
      "text": "[mtane0412.icon]",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1789805547,
      "updated": 1789805547
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae43eb00000000004b3dd6",
      "text": " [エホバの証人]が[輸血]一部[解禁]したらしい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789805548,
      "updated": 1789827247
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae43f500000000004b3dd7",
      "text": "  何があったんだろう",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1789805558,
      "updated": 1789805560
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae49c70000000000e791f4",
      "text": "  意外。なにがあったんだ[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1789807047,
      "updated": 1789807054
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4aca00000000006b057e",
      "text": " \t気になったのでぐぐる[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789807311,
      "updated": 1789807313
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4ad000000000006b057f",
      "text": " \t [https://www.tokyo-np.co.jp/article/481264 教義を変更「こんな簡単に…」 エホバの証人が「自己血輸血」認める見解 なぜ突然？ 医療現場の葛藤は続く：東京新聞デジタル]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789807313,
      "updated": 1789807316
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4aa700000000006b057d",
      "text": "  \t\t>教団は今回、「よく祈ってじっくり[聖書]を調べた結果、見方を調整することにした」とし、",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789807272,
      "updated": 1789827212
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4ad600000000006b0580",
      "text": "  \tよく分からんということが分かった",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789807319,
      "updated": 1789807324
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4afd00000000006b0581",
      "text": "  \tあと、今年３月には自分の血液を保存しておいて自分に輸血は許可が出てたのか",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789807358,
      "updated": 1789827224
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae989900000000008e3558",
      "text": "  \t　#自分への輸血",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1789827227,
      "updated": 1789827236
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4b0c00000000006b0582",
      "text": "  \t血液って保存期間短かったような、それを保存しておいて使うって事故等による大量出血に対応出来ない気がして、どういう場合を想定しているのやら",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789807373,
      "updated": 1789807435
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4b3e00000000006b0583",
      "text": "  \t病気による外科手術が分かっている時に、その手術日に合わせて血液を保存、ということかな？",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789807435,
      "updated": 1789807445
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4b9d00000000006b0584",
      "text": "  \t[https://topics.smt.docomo.ne.jp/article/fnn/nation/fnn-1117625 【独自】エホバの証人、「他人の血」輸血を一部容認へ 内部文書入手 全血は禁止維持（FNNプライムオンライン）｜ｄメニューニュース（NTTドコモ）]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789807518,
      "updated": 1789807527
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4ba600000000006b0585",
      "text": "   \t>今回新たに、他人の血液に由来する4つの主要成分「赤血球」「白血球」「血漿」「血小板」の輸血を解禁する方針",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789807527,
      "updated": 1789807548
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae4bbd00000000006b0586",
      "text": "   普通の輸血が何か分からんのでこれが特殊なのかどうか分からぬ",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789807549,
      "updated": 1789807697
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae5ffc000000000028c48a",
      "text": "  まじか[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1789812733,
      "updated": 1789812737
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae43f800000000004b3dd8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1789805560,
      "updated": 1789805561
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7acd00000000006b058b",
      "text": "[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789819598,
      "updated": 1789819599
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7ace00000000006b058c",
      "text": "\t墓参り行ってきた",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789819599,
      "updated": 1789819605
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7ad300000000006b058d",
      "text": "\t\t[お彼岸]だからか駐車場いっぱい",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789819605,
      "updated": 1789835859
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7afb00000000006b058e",
      "text": "\t\t大体二週間に一回のペースで墓参りというか掃除してるから普段との落差ぱねぇと気づく",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789819644,
      "updated": 1789819682
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7b2200000000006b058f",
      "text": "\t\tどうでもいい小ネタというか、勝手に思っていること",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789819683,
      "updated": 1789819700
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7b3300000000006b0590",
      "text": "\t\t\t墓をきちんと掃除出来ているかどうかは角に溜まった汚れを見ると察せられる、と思う",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789819700,
      "updated": 1789819720
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7b4800000000006b0591",
      "text": "\t\t\tつまりは墓石のL字の構造になっている部分に砂埃って溜まるよねという話",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789819721,
      "updated": 1789819756
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae7acd00000000006b058a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "65e1289acd012200235729c0",
      "created": 1789819597,
      "updated": 1789819597
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae81270000000000e877cb",
      "text": "[Hyou.icon]⚠️⛔️",
      "userId": "657c19a3646988002500645a",
      "created": 1789821224,
      "updated": 1789821435
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae81270000000000e877cc",
      "text": " みえ、みえ…み…",
      "userId": "657c19a3646988002500645a",
      "created": 1789821224,
      "updated": 1789821242
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae813c0000000000e877ce",
      "text": " \t俺がいない、昨日の私は",
      "userId": "657c19a3646988002500645a",
      "created": 1789821245,
      "updated": 1789821318
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae82130000000000e877cf",
      "text": " 掃除をサボっていたせいで、部屋が大変なことになっていたので、掃除するなどした。",
      "userId": "657c19a3646988002500645a",
      "created": 1789821459,
      "updated": 1789821478
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae82280000000000e877d0",
      "text": " \tおかげで鼻炎がよくなったような、そんな気がする。",
      "userId": "657c19a3646988002500645a",
      "created": 1789821480,
      "updated": 1789821506
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae82ac0000000000e877d1",
      "text": " \t[オスバンS]で床を水拭き",
      "userId": "657c19a3646988002500645a",
      "created": 1789821612,
      "updated": 1789821733
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae82be0000000000e877d2",
      "text": " \t\t水拭きは楽しい。達成感がある",
      "userId": "657c19a3646988002500645a",
      "created": 1789821630,
      "updated": 1789821783
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae9012000000000070dd5f",
      "text": " \t\tよさそう[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1789825042,
      "updated": 1789825045
    },
    {
      "id": "6aae81280000000000e877cd",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "657c19a3646988002500645a",
      "created": 1789821224,
      "updated": 1789821224
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad58cb6eb406000000a268ee",
      "text": "[2026/09/18.icon] ← 2026/09/19 → [2026/09/20.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789745356,
      "updated": 1789745356
    },
    {
      "id": "6aad58cb6eb40600000083ddcb",
      "text": "[/ [2026/09.icon]]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1789745356,
      "updated": 1789745356
    }
  ]
}